[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0010","text":"辛苦了\n来，这是饮料"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0020","text":"制作人买来的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0030","text":"啊……！\n谢谢您"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0040","text":"……今天拍得真特别呢\n平时大多在摄影棚里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0050","text":"是，是啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0060","text":"虽然是室外，但这么贴近自然的地方\n拍摄时可能还是第一次"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0070","text":"从组合的形象来说\n我也没想到会来这种地方拍"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0080","text":"……！\n是、是啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0090","text":"……嗯\n不过"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_03_0100","text":"挺有意思的\n……那个绳梯"}]
